# Part in Friendship: "... If its mana value is less than or equal to the number of lands you control, put it onto the battlefield.
# Otherwise, put it into your hand." Only its controller's lands count. Bot1 has played no land; Bot2 has a Mountain. When Bot2's
# Lightning Bolt kills Bot1's Ornithopter, the revealed Llanowar Elves (mana value 1) is more than Bot1's zero lands, so it goes to
# Bot1's hand, not onto the battlefield (the opponent's Mountain would have made it one).

